(% class="legend-box" %)
**Legend:** (% style="color:#f1c40f" %)🏆 Best-in-slot(%%) · (% style="color:#7fdbff" %)⭐ Strong endgame(%%) · (% style="color:#b39ddb" %)🟣 Rare/Ex(%%) · (% style="color:#fff176" %)🟡 Rare(%%) · Links go to **bg-wiki.com**.

(% class="legend-box" %)
**BLU is a physical DD by default.** Spell mods + Chain Affinity rely on **STR + Acc + multi-hit** for the Big Three (Vorpal Blade / Savage Blade / Expiacion). Cannonball / Healing / Magical-nuke / Breath builds are situational and called out where relevant.

{{toc/}}

----

= Trust Recommendations =

You melee/magic hybrid — BLU spells / Chain Affinity / Burst Affinity / Diffusion. Need: Tank, healer, **Refresh** (spells eat MP), Haste.

{{html clean="false"}}
<table class="gt">
<thead><tr><th style="width:60px;">Slot</th><th style="width:200px;">Trust</th><th>Why</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td class="lv">1</td><td>🛡️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/August">August</a></strong></td><td>Tank — BLU has no hate reduction tools</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">2</td><td>✨ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Apururu_(UC)">Apururu UC</a></strong></td><td>Haste on melee, Convert — your self-cures eat BLU slots</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">3</td><td>🔮 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Koru-Moru">Koru-Moru</a></strong></td><td>**Refresh for spell spam**, Haste, Slow/Distract</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">4</td><td>🎵 <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Joachim">Joachim</a></strong></td><td>March/Madrigal boost multi-hit physical spells (Heavy Strike, Disseverment)</td></tr>
<tr><td class="lv">5</td><td>⚔️ <strong><a href="https://www.bg-wiki.com/ffxi/Zeid_II">Zeid II</a></strong></td><td>DPS + stun interrupts</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
{{/html}}

